Upstream repository: https://github.com/HLasse/TextDescriptives
Paper: https://doi.org/10.21105/joss.05153

This is a source-vendored subset, not the complete upstream distribution.
UPSTREAM.json records the release, archive URL, archive SHA256, and per-file
source and local hashes. CITATION.cff is preserved from the source archive.

Local changes:
- The package initializer imports only the retained components and declares the
  upstream version without querying installed distribution metadata.
- The components initializer imports only the retained metric components.
- Metric implementations and their shared component utilities are unchanged.

Omitted: dataframe extractors, model-download helpers, scikit-learn integration,
quality and coherence components, example datasets, upstream development and
release tooling, documentation, and paper artifacts.

The upstream NumPy upper bound and dependencies needed only by omitted features
are not part of this package. Compatibility is tested against the dependencies
resolved in the enclosing cpi-prose uv.lock.
